{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098984-need-advice-for-a-new-storyteller-angle","id":1098984,"title":"Need advice for a new storyteller angle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-31T19:19:19-07:00","id":1098984,"title":"Need advice for a new storyteller angle","content":"So im currently writing my first CtL game i am gonna play with some very experienced gamers. So we have played sin-eater, vampire, mage, scion, hunter and a shit load of other d20 fantasy games and Coc.<br /> I feel that storytelling horror always ends up with body parts, dark places and an extremely creepy setting. I was looking into changeling because it contains the whole terrifying beauty theme. Now my question is how do you bring this theme of terrifying beauty to the table without having the gore and darkness.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13090-kirst","name":"Kirst","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T07:25:13-07:00","id":1099506,"title":"","content":"The Huntsmen, it's the horror of knowing someone is always after you, the horror of being kidnapped and knowing it's likely to happen again. <br /> <br /> Then there is the horror of fading clarity, and losing touch with what is real and what is a delusion. <br /> <br /> None of that requires gore and all of it can be presented beautifully without losing it horror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-02T07:51:37-07:00","id":1099518,"title":"","content":"Have you ever seen Jessica Jones?<br /> Main character has to (repeatedly) deal with the horror of their abuser and horribly messed up situations, but it's never a matter of gore or darkness. The horror comes from how messed up the actions are and how people can have perspectives that lack so much clarity that they basically live in their own worlds where everything that they do is justified.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 06-02-2017, 10:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T16:06:44-07:00","id":1100243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1098984-need-advice-for-a-new-storyteller-angle?p=1099518#post1099518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you ever seen Jessica Jones?<br /> Main character has to (repeatedly) deal with the horror of their abuser and horribly messed up situations, but it's never a matter of gore or darkness. The horror comes from how messed up the actions are and how people can have perspectives that lack so much clarity that they basically live in their own worlds where everything that they do is justified.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^THIS. That is the horror of the True Fae and many a low-clarity changeling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T16:12:07-07:00","id":1100249,"title":"","content":"Plus, you can play up the role of the Wyrd and its obsession with stories. If you aren't careful, you find yourself falling into a role, and god help you if you're cast as the spear carrier or the villain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}